 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Microsoft.Web api-version 2025-05-01 swagger. Every other official operation of this api-version returns HTTP 501 NotImplemented. Plan metadata only: no worker, site, deployment, certificate or hybrid connection exists; numberOfSites stays 0. The official plan PATCH definition has no tags; change tags with a full create-or-update. detailed is accepted because every stored property is always returned. Sites, App Service Environments, Kubernetes environments, registry adapters, storage mounts and every other operation are not implemented (HTTP 501).",
